<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    {{>layout/site-head}}
    <title>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다 - 트리플에스</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#0d0e12] text-[#e3e2e8] min-h-screen">
{{>layout/header}}
<main class="main-content max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-mono text-[#00f5d4] mb-3">404</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">요청한 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다</h1>
    <p class="text-[#b9cac4] mb-8">{{message}}</p>
    <a href="{{listPath}}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[#00f5d4]/40 px-4 py-2 text-[#00f5d4] no-underline hover:bg-[#00f5d4]/10">{{listLabel}}</a>
</main>
{{>layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>
